---
// FAQ Accordion Section
---

<section id="faq" class="faq-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <span class="section-label">Frequently asked questions</span>
      <h2>Your Questions,<br/>Answered</h2>

      <div class="faq-accordion">
        <details class="faq-item" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">What is FollowBirds?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>FollowBirds is a birdwatching platform for Portugal. It helps guides run tours, share live sightings, and generate automatic reports for every participant.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">How do guided tours work?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Guides create tours from reusable templates and invite participants via email, link, or QR code. During the tour, everyone follows live sightings. At the end, FollowBirds automatically generates a detailed report.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">Can guides create reusable templates?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes. Guides can build tour templates with pre-set routes, species checklists, and notes, then reuse them to create new dated tours effortlessly.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">Can I export reports?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes. Reports can be exported as PDF, shared via a web link, or accessed directly within the FollowBirds app.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">Who can become a guide?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Any birding professional or enthusiastic guide who leads tours in Portugal can apply. Email <a href="mailto:guides@followbirds.com">guides@followbirds.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
  }

  .faq-layout {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .faq-layout h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* ── FAQ Accordion ── */
  .faq-accordion {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid #D1D3C8;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #D1D3C8;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-item summary:hover {
    background: #F4EFF6;
  }

  .faq-item[open] > summary {
    background: #F4EFF6;
  }

  .faq-q {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111815;
    flex: 1;
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-toggle {
    color: #559858;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-toggle {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    padding: 0 1.25rem 1rem;
    animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease;
  }

  .faq-answer p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #727272;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .faq-answer a {
    color: #559858;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .faq-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
